  <p id="c-nanshi-023-wangqian-mothers:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangqian-mothers:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAF">僉</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangqian-mothers:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAF">公會</persName>，八歲丁父憂，哀毀過禮。初補國子生，祭酒<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangqian-mothers:p001:m0024" ref="hb9_2gq_205">袁昂</persName>稱為通理。累遷始興內史，丁<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangqian-mothers:p001:m0039" ref="4w4_f68_91v">所生母</persName>憂，固辭不拜。又除南康內史，在郡<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangqian-mothers:p001:m0058" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_AB">義興主</persName>薨，詔起復郡。</p>
</text>
